# Kanak Fastfood Corner & Kanak FoodCoat Project Readme

Welcome to the **Kanak Fastfood Corner / Kanak Foods** repository. This workspace contains a dual-architecture implementation of a high-performance, responsive food delivery platform tailored for authentic Indian cuisine.

The workspace consists of two distinct sub-projects:
1. **`WEB/`**: A full-stack Next.js 16 food ordering Progressive Web App (PWA) powered by TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Supabase, TanStack Query, and Razorpay.
2. **`WEBSTORE/`**: A highly interactive, zero-dependency static webstore built with pure HTML5, CSS3, and vanilla JavaScript.

