## 🧪 Project Verification & Testing

Verify code quality, buildability, and regression safety using the following suite of commands:

```bash
cd WEB

# Run unit and PWA manifest validation tests
npm test

# Run strict cart and coupon pricing engine tests
npm run test:pricing

# Run TypeScript static analysis
npx tsc --noEmit

# Run code linter
npm run lint

# Compile and build the Next.js site
npm run build
```

*Note: Integration tests (via `npm run test:integration`) require local staging configuration with `INTEGRATION_*` environment variables loaded, and should never run against a production instance.*
